   "evidence": {
    "file": "django/contrib/auth/forms.py",
    "line": 289,
    "why": "UserChangeForm (and BaseUserCreationForm at forms.py:229) call super().__init__() whose nearest defining ancestor in the MRO is BaseModelForm.__init__ at models.py:348, since the immediate parent ModelForm is an empty pass-through class; this is a real, frequently-exercised call path that no in-scope classifier addresses."
